[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_02_0010","text":"────听说这附近，有一座山神的神社"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_02_0020","text":"我们是外来人\n去打个招呼，请神明保佑外景顺利吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_02_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_02_0030","text":"制作人大人……\n路……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_02_0040","text":"嗯，岔路口吗\n我看看……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_02_0050","text":"……正确答案好像是右边的台阶"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_02_0060","text":"不过，路比想象中难走啊\n凛世要在这里等着吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_02_0070","text":"…………\n凛世也……一起去……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_02_0080","text":"……好，知道了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_02_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_02_0090","text":"那就不好意思了，抓住我的胳膊吧\n别摔着了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200100_02_0100","text":"好……好的……"}]
